    "earlyBlueLiquidity": "AI has blue3 in slot2 and later blue1 slot3; teacher has blue1 slot2. The exact production slot prerequisite is audited separately. More cash earlier may change card development and trace/scan throughput; current data alone does not prove its score effect.",
    "cardOpportunityCost": "AI discards held Amiba7 at206 and Chong2 at246, whereas the teacher plays them for trace endgame scoring. Retention must pay actual deployment and foregone data/income; their teacher-final scores are not free recoverable points."
