  "priorityDecision": {
    "choose": "Audit the earlier second-round blue1-versus-blue3 whole-development choice before another late card-first plan.",
    "why": "Current late controls repeatedly show real cash and timing constraints. The scoring bridge places most endgame gap in trace throughput/trace cards, and blue cash position is an upstream difference already present before the analyzed third-round branches.",
    "notARevert": "V189 historical first-two-round alignment had the teacher concrete slots. Current formal272 differs; compare current exact source and legal root, not blindly restore old policy.",
